# Custom Frappe apps — authored by this project (not vendored/external), but each is its own
# git repo because Frappe's `bench` tooling requires that to mount/link an app into a bench
# (a bare non-git directory isn't supported by `bench get-app`, even locally). Tracked in their
# own repos, same mechanism as the vendored projects above, not because they're external.
/backend/korkem_manufacturing/
/backend/korkem_ai/

